#solution[
函数 $f ( x ) = sin (  omega x +  phi  ) (  omega   >  0 ,  0  <   phi   <  ( pi  )/(2 ) )  $ 图象的一个对称中心是 $( - ( pi  )/(8 ) ,  0 )  $ , 

依题意,  $ - ( pi  )/(8 )  omega  +  phi  = k  1    pi  ,  k  1   ∈ Z    ( pi  )/(8 )  omega  +  phi  = ( pi  )/(2 ) + k  2    pi  ,  k  2   ∈ Z         $ , 

解得 $ phi  = ( pi  )/(4 ) + (( k  1   + k  2   )  pi  )/(2 ) ,  k  1   ,  k  2   ∈ Z  $ , 

ω=4 (k2-k1) +2=4n+2, k1, k2∈Z, k2-k1=n∈N, 而 $0  <   phi   <  ( pi  )/(2 )  $ , 

则 $ phi  = ( pi  )/(4 )  $ , 

 $f ( x ) = sin (  omega x + ( pi  )/(4 ) )  $ , 由 $x ∈ ( 0 ,  ( pi  )/(8 ) )  $ , 得 $ omega x + ( pi  )/(4 ) ∈ ( ( pi  )/(4 ) ,  ( pi  )/(8 )  omega  + ( pi  )/(4 ) )  $ , 

由f (x) 在区间 $( 0 ,  ( pi  )/(8 ) )  $ 上有且仅有两个零点, 得 $2  pi   <  ( pi  )/(8 )  omega  + ( pi  )/(4 )  <=  3  pi   $ , 解得14\<ω≤22, 

于是3\<n≤5, ω=18或ω=22, 当ω=22时,  $f ( x ) = sin ( 22 x + ( pi  )/(4 ) )  $ , 

 $f ( ( pi  )/(8 ) ) = sin 3  pi  = 0  $ , 不符合要求, 

当ω=18时,  $f ( x ) = sin ( 18 x + ( pi  )/(4 ) )  $ ,  $f ( - ( pi  )/(8 ) ) = sin ( - 2  pi  ) = 0 ,  f ( ( pi  )/(8 ) ) = sin (5  pi  )/(2 ) = 1  $ , 符合题意, 

所以ω=18．

故答案为: 18．

]
]

