 (2)  $- ( pi  )/(2 ) + 2 m pi   <=  2 x - ( pi  )/(3 )  <=  ( pi  )/(2 ) + 2 m pi  ( m ∈ Z ) ⇒ - ( pi  )/(12 ) + m pi   <=  x  <=  (5  pi  )/(12 ) + m pi  ( m ∈ Z )  $ , 

令m=0, 得 $- ( pi  )/(12 )  <=  x  <=  (5  pi  )/(12 )  $ , 所以 $x ∈ [ - ( pi  )/(12 ) ,  (5  pi  )/(12 ) ]  $ , 而x∈\[0, π\], 

所以 $x ∈ [ 0 ,  (5  pi  )/(12 ) ]  $ , 

令m=1, 得 $(11  pi  )/(12 )  <=  x  <=  (17  pi  )/(12 )  $ , 所以 $x ∈ [ (11  pi  )/(12 ) ,  (17  pi  )/(12 ) ]  $ , 而x∈\[0, π\], 

所以 $x ∈ [ (11  pi  )/(12 ) ,   pi  ]  $ , 

所以函数f (x) 在\[0, π\]上的单调递增区间为 $[ 0 ,  (5  pi  )/(12 ) ]  $ 和 $[ (11  pi  )/(12 ) ,   pi  ]  $ ; 

 (3)  $g ( x ) = f ( m x ) - m f ( x ) = 2 sin ( 2 m x - ( pi  )/(3 ) ) - 2 m sin ( 2 x - ( pi  )/(3 ) )  $ , 

当m\>1时,  $g ( 0 ) = 2  times  ( - (sqrt(3 ) )/(2 ) ) - 2 m • ( - (sqrt(3 ) )/(2 ) ) = sqrt(3 ) ( m - 1 )  >  0  $ , 

