而x3, x4是 $x + (4 )/(x ) - 4 = t  $ 的两根, 即x2- (4+t) x+4=0, 

因为t∈ (0, 3\], 满足 $ Δ = ( 4 + t )  2   - 16  >  0    x  3   + x  4   = 4 + t  >  0    x  3   x  4   = 4  >  0         $ , 所以x3+x4=4+t,

 $(3  x  2   - 2 x  1     )/(x  3   + x  4   ) = (3  x  2     ÷ 3  2 x  1     )/(4 + t ) = ((1 )/(4 - t ) ÷ ( (1 )/(4 + t ) )  2   )/(4 - t ) = - (t + 4 )/(t - 4 ) = - 1 - (8 )/(t - 4 ) ′  $ 

