 $f ( (1 )/(2 ) ) = (8 )/(sqrt(2 ) + 4 ) = (16 - 4 sqrt(2 ) )/(7 )  <  (10 . 5 )/(7 ) = (3 )/(2 )  $ ,  $f ( 1 ) = (4 )/(3 )  >  1 = g ( 1 )  $ , 

