令 $sin x - cos x = t , t ∈ [ - sqrt(2 ) ,  sqrt(2 ) ]  $ , 

则2sinxcosx=1-t2, 

故 $h ( t ) =  lambda  [ (sqrt(2 ) )/(2 ) t + ( 1 - t  2   ) ] =  lambda  [ - ( t - (sqrt(2 ) )/(4 ) )  2   + (9 )/(8 ) ]  $ ,  $t ∈ [ - sqrt(2 ) ,  sqrt(2 ) ]  $ , 

当λ\>0时, 此时 $h ( t )  max   = h ( (sqrt(2 ) )/(4 ) ) = (9 )/(8 )  lambda  = 1  $ , 解得 $ lambda  = (8 )/(9 )  $ , 

此时 $h ( x ) = (8 )/(9 ) sin ( x - ( pi  )/(4 ) ) + (8 )/(9 ) sin 2 x  $ 

当λ\<0时, 此时 $h ( t )  max   = h ( - sqrt(2 ) ) =  lambda  ( - 1 + 1 - 2 ) = 1  $ , 解得 $ lambda  = - (1 )/(2 )  $ , 

此时 $h ( x ) = - (1 )/(2 ) sin ( x - ( pi  )/(4 ) ) - (1 )/(2 ) sin 2 x  $ , 

所以 $h ( x ) = - (1 )/(2 ) sin ( x - ( pi  )/(4 ) ) - (1 )/(2 ) sin 2 x  $ 或 $h ( x ) = (8 )/(9 ) sin ( x - ( pi  )/(4 ) ) + (8 )/(9 ) sin 2 x  $ ; 

 (2) (Ⅰ) 设 $h ( x ) =  lambda log  2   ( 4  x   + 1 ) +  mu  ( (1 )/(2 ) x + 1 )  $ , 

所以 $h ( - x ) =  lambda log  2   ( 4  - x   + 1 ) +  mu  ( - (1 )/(2 ) x + 1 ) =  lambda log  2   ( 4  x   + 1 ) - 2 x lambda  +  mu  ( - (1 )/(2 ) x + 1 )  $ , 

又因为h (x) 为偶函数, 所以h (-x) =h (x) , 

即 $ lambda log  2   ( 4  x   + 1 ) +  mu  ( (1 )/(2 ) x + 1 ) =  lambda log  2   ( 4  x   + 1 ) - 2 x lambda  +  mu  ( - (1 )/(2 ) x + 1 )  $ , 

整理得μx=-2xλ, 对任意x恒成立, 则μ=-2λ, 

又h (0) =-1, 

则λlog22+μ=-1, 即λ+μ=-λ=-1, 解得以μ=-2, λ=1, 

所以函数h (x) 的解析式为 $h ( x ) = log  2   ( 4  x   + 1 ) - x - 2  $ ; 

 (Ⅱ) 由 (Ⅰ) 知 $h ( x ) = log  2   ( 4  x   + 1 ) - x - 2 = log  2   ( (4  x   + 1 )/(2  x   ) ) - 2 = log  2   ( 2  x   + 2  - x   ) - 2  $ , 

令t=2x, 则 $x ∈ [ - 1 ,  1 ] ,  t ∈ [ (1 )/(2 ) ,  2 ]  $ , 

故对勾函数 $y = t + (1 )/(t )  $ 在 $t ∈ [ (1 )/(2 ) ,  1 ]  $ 单调递减, 在t∈\[1, 2\]单调递增, 

由于t=2x单调递增, 

因此函数h (x) 在\[0, 1\]上单调递增, 在\[-1, 0\]上单调递减．

设xk≤0≤xk+1 (xk≠xk+1) , k=0, 1, 2, 3, ⋯, n-1, 

