所以M=|h (x1) -h (x0) |+|h (x2) -h (x1) |+⋯+|h (xn) -h (xn-1) |

=h (x0) -h (x1) +h (x1) -h (x2) +⋯

+h (xk-1) -h (xk) +|h (xk+1) -h (xk) |+h (xk+2) -h (xk+1) +h (xk+3) -h (xk+2) +⋯+h (xn) -h (xn-1) 

=h (x0) -h (xk) +|h (xk+1) -h (xk) |+h (xn) -h (xk+1) 

